The window starts as {50, 50, 50}. If three new readings arrive (200, 200, 50), what does the median print?

```
float p[3] = {50, 50, 50};
int s = 0;
float yeni[] = {200, 200, 50};
for (int i = 0; i < 3; i++) {
  p[s] = yeni[i];
  s = (s + 1) % 3;
}
float a = p[0], b = p[1], c = p[2];
Serial.println(max(min(a, b), min(max(a, b), c)), 0);
```

